     A*
     A* Matrix Payment File - Detail
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 01/27/2003 by c:62 for Project 114MEK
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Purpose: This file will house the payment record for the
     A*          associated Matrix records.  Additional fields will be
     A*          added to the end of the file to hold information
     A*          specific to the matchup of the claim in PDS.  It will
     A*          be tied to the FAP1P record via P2INV#.
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:
     A*
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PP201                     TEXT('Matrix Payment Detail')
     A            P2INV#    R               REFFLD(DS25)
     A                                      COLHDG('Invoice #')
     A            P2INVL    R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      COLHDG('Invoice Line #')
     A            P2RXDT    R               REFFLD(DT8)
     A                                      COLHDG('Rx Fill Date')
     A            P2RX#     R               REFFLD(DS25)
     A                                      COLHDG('Rx Number')
     A            P2RFIL    R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      COLHDG('Refill')
     A            P2BRND    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Brand')
     A            P2DAW     R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('Dispensed as Written')
     A            P2QNTW    R               REFFLD(DS25)
     A                                      COLHDG('Quantity Written')
     A            P2QNTD    R               REFFLD(DS25)
     A                                      COLHDG('Quantity Dispensed')
     A            P2PRSC    R               REFFLD(DS50)
     A                                      COLHDG('Prescription')
     A            P2NDC     R               REFFLD(DS15)
     A                                      COLHDG('NDC')
     A            P2DNAM    R               REFFLD(DS25)
     A                                      COLHDG('Drug Name')
     A            P2STRG    R               REFFLD(DS25)
     A                                      COLHDG('Drug Strength')
     A            P2CHRG    R     S         REFFLD(A92)
     A                                      COLHDG('Charge')
     A            P2NTWK    R     S         REFFLD(A92)
     A                                      COLHDG('Network')
     A            P2PAID    R     S         REFFLD(A92)
     A                                      COLHDG('Paid')
     A            P2PAAD    R     S         REFFLD(A92)
     A                                      COLHDG('Paid/Adjusted')
     A            P2OUTS    R     S         REFFLD(A92)
     A                                      COLHDG('Outstanding')
     A*****************************************************************
     A            P2EOB#    R               REFFLD(EOB#)
     A                                      COLHDG('(PDS) EOMB')
     A            P2DSEQ    R               REFFLD(SEQ#)
     A                                      COLHDG('(PDS) EOMB')
     A            P2PRFL    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('(PDS) Processed Flag')
